WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to Ward 42 Fix-It. This video shows you how to report a fault.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Tap Report a fault, choose the kind of problem and type the street name.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Describe the problem, then type your name and cell number.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Add a photo if you can, then tap Submit report.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Write down your reference number. You can use it to check the status later.
